.TH SWIFT-TOUCH-KDE-TRAY 1 "April 2026" "swift-touch-kde 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
swift-touch-kde-tray \- system tray controller for Swift Touch KDE media daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swift-touch-kde-tray
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches a KDE tray icon that shows media service state and provides controls
for start/stop/restart, autostart toggling, and live log access.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/autostart/swift-touch-kde-tray.desktop
Global autostart entry installed by package.
